<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bn">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Tajim | Lifestyle & Everyday Moments</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --deep-blue: #0A2540;
      --soft-blue: #1B3A5F;
      --accent-blue: #3A7CA5;
      --off-white: #F8F7F4;
      --warm-white: #FFFFFF;
      --text-dark: #1A1A1A;
      --text-muted: #5A5A5A;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--off-white);
      color: var(--text-dark);
      line-height: 1.7;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    /* Navbar */
    nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 18px 7%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      background: rgba(248, 247, 244, 0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      z-index: 1000;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(10, 37, 64, 0.08);
    }

    .logo {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.7rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--deep-blue);
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 36px;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--deep-blue);
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--accent-blue);
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0A2540 0%, #1B3A5F 100%);
      color: var(--off-white);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      width: 700px;
      height: 700px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(58, 124, 165, 0.22) 0%, transparent 70%);
      top: -200px;
      right: -150px;
      animation: float 9s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: 900px;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 4.8rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(40px);
      animation: fadeUp 1.1s ease forwards 0.3s;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(30px);
      animation: fadeUp 1.1s ease forwards 0.6s;
      color: rgba(248, 247, 244, 0.9);
    }

    .location {
      margin-top: 25px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 1.1s ease forwards 0.9s;
      color: #A8D0E6;
    }

    /* Sections */
    section {
      padding: 100px 7%;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 2.6rem;
      color: var(--deep-blue);
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .section-subtitle {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 60px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    /* About */
    .about {
      background: var(--warm-white);
    }

    .about-content {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* Gallery */
    .gallery-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .gallery-item {
      height: 320px;
      background: linear-gradient(45deg, #1B3A5F, #3A7CA5);
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
      transition: transform 0.4s ease;
    }

    .gallery-item:hover {
      transform: translateY(-10px);
    }

    .gallery-item::after {
      content: 'Coming Soon';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: white;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      background: rgba(10, 37, 64, 0.4);
    }

    /* Lifestyle Posts */
    .posts {
      background: var(--warm-white);
    }

    .post-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 35px;
    }

    .post-card {
      background: var(--off-white);
      border-radius: 18px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(10, 37, 64, 0.06);
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .post-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(10, 37, 64, 0.1);
    }

    .post-img {
      height: 220px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1B3A5F, #3A7CA5);
    }

    .post-content {
      padding: 28px;
    }

    .post-content h3 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      color: var(--deep-blue);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .post-content p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.98rem;
    }

    /* Contact */
    .contact {
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0A2540, #1B3A5F);
      color: var(--off-white);
    }

    .contact .section-title {
      color: var(--off-white);
    }

    .contact a {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding: 14px 40px;
      background: var(--off-white);
      color: var(--deep-blue);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .contact a:hover {
      background: #E8F0F7;
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      background: var(--deep-blue);
      color: rgba(248, 247, 244, 0.7);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    /* Animations */
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes float {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
      50% { transform: translateY(30px); }
    }

    /* Mobile */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .nav-links {
        display: none;
      }
      section {
        padding: 70px 5%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Navbar -->
  <nav>
    <div class="logo">Tajim</div>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
      <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="#gallery">Gallery</a></li>
      <li><a href="#lifestyle">Lifestyle</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>Everyday Moments</h1>
      <p>Capturing life, one beautiful frame at a time</p>
      <div class="location">Cumilla, Bangladesh</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About -->
  <section class="about" id="about">
    <h2 class="section-title">About Me</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Digital Creator & Lifestyle Enthusiast</p>
    <div class="about-content">
      <p>
        হ্যালো, আমি তাজিম। কুমিল্লা থেকে। জীবনের ছোট ছোট সুন্দর মুহূর্তগুলোকে ক্যামেরাবন্দি করতে ভালোবাসি। 
        এই সাইটে আপনারা পাবেন আমার দৈনন্দিন জীবন, ভ্রমণ, খাবার এবং লাইফস্টাইলের গল্প।
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Gallery -->
  <section id="gallery">
    <h2 class="section-title">Gallery</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Some of my favorite moments</p>
    <div class="gallery-grid">
      <div class="gallery-item"></div>
      <div class="gallery-item"></div>
      <div class="gallery-item"></div>
      <div class="gallery-item"></div>
      <div class="gallery-item"></div>
      <div class="gallery-item"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Lifestyle Posts -->
  <section class="posts" id="lifestyle">
    <h2 class="section-title">Lifestyle</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Recent stories from my life</p>
    <div class="post-grid">
      <div class="post-card">
        <div class="post-img"></div>
        <div class="post-content">
          <h3>Quiet Afternoons</h3>
          <p>কুমিল্লার শান্ত বিকেলগুলো আমার সবচেয়ে প্রিয় সময়...</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="post-card">
        <div class="post-img"></div>
        <div class="post-content">
          <h3>City Lights & Moments</h3>
          <p>শহরের আলোয় হারিয়ে যাওয়া কিছু স্মৃতি...</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="post-card">
        <div class="post-img"></div>
        <div class="post-content">
          <h3>New Beginnings</h3>
          <p>প্রতিটি নতুন দিন নতুন গল্প নিয়ে আসে...</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact -->
  <section class="contact" id="contact">
    <h2 class="section-title">Let's Connect</h2>
    <p>আমার সাথে যোগাযোগ রাখতে Facebook-এ ফলো করুন</p>
    <a href="https://www.facebook.com/tajim.islam.823980" target="_blank">Visit Facebook</a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Tajim — Lifestyle from Cumilla
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
